{"RukuNumber":497,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":67,"SurahIndex":"067","VerseNumber":15,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِي جَعَلَ لَكُمُ ٱلۡأَرۡضَ ذَلُولٗا فَٱمۡشُواْ فِي مَنَاكِبِهَا وَكُلُواْ مِن رِّزۡقِهِۦۖ وَإِلَيۡهِ ٱلنُّشُورُ","TajweedText":"هُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِى جَعَلَ لَكُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضَ ذَلُول<tajweed class=ikhafa>اً ف</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>مْشُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> فِى مَنَاكِبِهَا وَكُلُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> م<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ر</tajweed>ِّزْقِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed>‌ۖ وَإِلَيْهِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>ُش<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>رُ <span class=end>١٥</span>","End":"١٥","PageNumber":563,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":497,"MaqraNumber":225,"HizbNumber":57,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":67,"SurahIndex":"067","VerseNumber":16,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"ءَأَمِنتُم مَّن فِي ٱلسَّمَآءِ أَن يَخۡسِفَ بِكُمُ ٱلۡأَرۡضَ فَإِذَا هِيَ تَمُورُ","TajweedText":"ءَأَمِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>َّ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ف</tajweed>ِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ أ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>َخْسِفَ بِكُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضَ فَإِذَا هِىَ تَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>رُ <span class=end>١٦</span>","End":"١٦","PageNumber":563,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":497,"MaqraNumber":225,"HizbNumber":57,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":67,"SurahIndex":"067","VerseNumber":17,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ أَمِنتُم مَّن فِي ٱلسَّمَآءِ أَن يُرۡسِلَ عَلَيۡكُمۡ حَاصِبٗاۖ فَسَتَعۡلَمُونَ كَيۡفَ نَذِيرِ",